{"game": "roboquest", "language": "english", "appid": 692890, "month": "2026-10", "window": 1, "start_date": 1790812800, "end_date": 1793491199, "month_true_total": 7, "quota": 7, "returned": 7, "pulled_at": "2026-10-03 01:57:25 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "236733890", "author": {"steamid": "76561198042241439", "personaname": "PorucznikBorewicz", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198042241439/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 1121, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1121, "last_played": 1786492198, "avatar": "154d68f533e4430c7f3b06d1170f897d3fce08ce"}, "language": "english", "review": "we need Cyberpunk2077 DLC. New bot, netrunner or something else? Cyberpunk combat OST? \nMusorshchiki ost for moon final boss? or maybay something of esster egg new, pistol Malorian Arms 3516 for cocosplay silverhend? WEE NEED CYBERPUNK DLC :D !", "timestamp_created": 1790979127, "timestamp_updated": 1790979127, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "236715665", "author": {"steamid": "76561198100887064", "personaname": "jz", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198100887064/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 5703, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 5703, "playtime_at_review": 5486, "deck_playtime_at_review": 3368, "last_played": 1790977157, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "10/10 amazing game\n", "timestamp_created": 1790963227, "timestamp_updated": 1790963227, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": true, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "236674617", "author": {"steamid": "76561199472570401", "personaname": "BING BONG", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199472570401/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 295, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 295, "playtime_at_review": 246, "last_played": 1790924464, "avatar": "cb3985fc749c18eac6a8bdc26c7d47781b7784b5"}, "language": "english", "review": "", "timestamp_created": 1790921554, "timestamp_updated": 1790921554, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "236668406", "author": {"steamid": "76561199249434772", "personaname": "Shmelio", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ShmelioShmelioShmelioShmelio/", "num_games_owned": 33, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 3678, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3678, "last_played": 1782148243, "avatar": "4a3f8dafac2fbbe0c4f55e94768279fac964cc80"}, "language": "english", "review": "I bought it immediately after seeing \"pow\" \"bam\" and \"bang\" appearing after every single shot, and thankfully it is an amazing roguelike shooter, heavily recommend for those who like funny text instead of sound design.", "timestamp_created": 1790912727, "timestamp_updated": 1790912727, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.545454561710357666", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "236648445", "author": {"steamid": "76561198410224191", "personaname": "OnyxLock", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198410224191/", "num_games_owned": 206, "num_reviews": 15, "playtime_forever": 4107, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 133, "playtime_at_review": 4107, "deck_playtime_at_review": 3484, "last_played": 1789941479, "avatar": "c0d7d3b9deae234f3b4f59a19abad4a01b07ccf2"}, "language": "english", "review": "I usually can't really get into fast-paced shooters or non turned-based roguelikes, but this game managed to break both of those molds at once for me. Only 2 hours into the demo I knew I needed the full game into my library. The effortlessly smooth gunplay, maneuverability tactics, and unrelenting (but adjustable) difficulty all just made me keep coming back for more better than other twitch shooters and some roguelikes could. The artstyle is fantastic, the music is REALLY AWESOME, and the story and dialogue are simple and cheeky, akin to a old action comic book, but it's just compelling enough for what the game needs.\nThe game also plays beautifully on a controller and on Steam Deck, too, despite needing to squint a bit for some text. The controller settings are adjustable to make aiming so much easier, to a point where you turn it into a literal aimbot if you like. (Which checks out since you're playing as a robot after all)\nDefinitely try out the demo for the game first, and it's it's up to speed for you, Roboquest is absolutely worth the price.", "timestamp_created": 1790887809, "timestamp_updated": 1790887846, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": true, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "236645998", "author": {"steamid": "76561198352998801", "personaname": "juno", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/juno261/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 615, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 549, "playtime_at_review": 615, "last_played": 1790881238, "avatar": "2eda563da1c05d2fed5bf0864661926b1bbfdaee"}, "language": "english", "review": "this game is a lot of fun, whether you play alone or with a friend. online co-op is really smooth and works unexpectedly well ( - no offense, we just weren't expecting it to be as straight-forward as it is!). we haven't had connection issues, and I think the way it handles progression for two players is well done. aside from one seemingly unreachable data log we haven't encountered any bugs and have been happily shooting away. just keep in mind the game can be time-consuming as each run gets reset when you leave the game, so plan wisely if you're planning to do a full run.", "timestamp_created": 1790885346, "timestamp_updated": 1790885346, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "hardware": {"system_ram": "31895", "os": "Windows 11", "cpu_name": "AMD Ryzen 5 7600X 6-Core Processor             ", "adapter_description": "NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4070 SUPER", "vram_size": 11997}, "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "236619233", "author": {"steamid": "76561198421801564", "personaname": "AB", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198421801564/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 45, "playtime_forever": 219, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 209, "playtime_at_review": 219, "last_played": 1790827115, "avatar": "752eb38c3b0bc6f74708ec2c3d44d00bda41edde"}, "language": "english", "review": "kewl", "timestamp_created": 1790861426, "timestamp_updated": 1790